  },
  "stimuli_or_exposures": [
    {
      "type": "VR",
      "description": "A virtual city designed with six distinct regions (Orange-Zone: cafes/restaurants, max 15m height; Purple-Zone: shopping centers/skyscrapers >15m; Yellow-Zone: human-scale residential, max 7m height; Green-Zone: parks/recreation, green architecture dominant; Red-Zone: amorphous geometries, different textures/materials; Blue-Zone: industrial zone, factory architecture). The city included narrow and wide streets, landmarks, intersections, and buildings of varying heights and geometries.",
